{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover many characters with their own  set of runes and cards and challenges. Prepare to dive into the world of Unbound Eternity, a <strong>turn-based combat game with deck-building features</strong> where you\u2019re not the hero <strong>BUT a MONSTER</strong>, invading the lands owned by a mysterious cult of &quot;the eye&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1377de9a00b0df36f249baf0f6039144.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/f7beebc3affed0cd55b3bfdffa3314aa.poster.avif?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/f7beebc3affed0cd55b3bfdffa3314aa.webm?t=1761415417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/f7beebc3affed0cd55b3bfdffa3314aa.mp4?t=1761415417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/69bab1817cf8dbed9f16d8ae63c4c4c7.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1bb07de7811d7f104cfb77f5e1a7081e.avif?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the army of the empress with your runes and cards, and face unpredictable events to grow stronger. Your goal? Survive and defeat the hero chosen by &quot;the eye&quot;. Break the cycle and claim your reign over the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1377de9a00b0df36f249baf0f6039144.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/2db2b41fa44baf8e84f6ee453f982e63.poster.avif?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/2db2b41fa44baf8e84f6ee453f982e63.webm?t=1761415417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/2db2b41fa44baf8e84f6ee453f982e63.mp4?t=1761415417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/69bab1817cf8dbed9f16d8ae63c4c4c7.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/b404ecaf37eb362d57e625d16d912c1a.avif?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget dull map navigation! Here, you <strong>build</strong> your own path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the battles you want\u00a0and collect their rewards: shop discounts, immortality (really?), permanent combat buffs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1377de9a00b0df36f249baf0f6039144.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/ff095a3d02d5744412ea3a14508b5857.poster.avif?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/ff095a3d02d5744412ea3a14508b5857.webm?t=1761415417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/ff095a3d02d5744412ea3a14508b5857.mp4?t=1761415417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/69bab1817cf8dbed9f16d8ae63c4c4c7.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/05bef1075481a9dd6d3e266681cbcf30.avif?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine tiles, gather artifacts, upgrade and craft your cards to <strong>BEAT THE GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use runes to play your cards and create combos. Multiply your damage, poison your enemies or sacrifice your own health to make powerful attacks!  Each rune represents an action during your turn, and as a monster, you naturally have several at your disposal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274090/extras/1377de9a00b0df36f249baf0f6039144.webp?t=1761415417\" width=616 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play